License: BSD-2-Clause; the complete product license is in LICENSE.

Upstream source is unchanged. A separate pbsandbox preload library confines the process.

HOME and the working directory are DATA_DIR, initially empty. A preloaded libfaketime fixes the wall clock; pbsandbox confines file access with Landlock and denies creation of external processes. Native calendar, to-do, note and configuration files persist under DATA_DIR.

calcurse-runtime-4.8.2.tar.gz is a locally built runtime package.
It contains the unchanged calcurse executable and a separate pbsandbox.so built
from pbsandbox.c. The matching source and build details are in SOURCE.json.
Upstream calcurse source: https://calcurse.org/files/calcurse-4.8.2.tar.gz
pbsandbox.c is task-authored and provided under the Apache License 2.0, the
license of the Program Bench Pro repository.

The shared execution environment uses libfaketime 0.9.12 (GPL-2.0-only).
